# Red Test Evidence

The SDLC run used focused red tests before implementation slices.

- `RED-cache-errors.log`: outage cache/error classifier tests failed before the server cache and classifier existed.
- `RED-provider-fallback.log`: provider fallback tests failed before `getLLMCompletion` routed retryable Anthropic failures to OpenAI.
- `RED-tutor-route.log`: tutor route retry tests failed before route-level retry signaling.
- `RED-tutor-ui-retry.log`: tutor UI retry helper tests failed before the retry helper existed.
- `RED-grading-route.log`: grading route retry tests failed before route-level retry signaling.
- `RED-openai-client-env.log`: OpenAI service test failed before exporting client options and allowing API-key-only configuration.

Representative red command:

```bash
bun test app/services/openai.test.ts
```

Result: failed with `Export named 'getOpenAiClientOptions' not found`.
